meta {
  name: List all evaluations
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/capacity-building?page=&limit=&orderBy=&search=&sortBy=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 
  limit: 
  orderBy: 
  search: 
  sortBy: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List All Capacity Building Evaluations

  Returns a paginated list of capacity building programme evaluation submissions. Results are ordered by creation date in ascending order. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default     | Description / Allowed Values                                                                            |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`         | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                                                                               |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`        | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                         |
  | orderBy   | string | No       | `desc`      | Sort direction. One of: `asc`, `desc`                                                                   |
  | sortBy    | string | No       | `createdAt` | One of: `programName`, `programType`, `programDate`, `location`, `programCoordinator`, `createdAt`      |
  | search    | string | No       | —           | Full-text search query. When provided, cache and sort filters are bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index. |

  ### Searchable Fields

  | Field                | Weight |
  |----------------------|--------|
  | `programName`        | A      |
  | `programType`        | A      |
  | `location`           | A      |
  | `programCoordinator` | A      |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of capacity building evaluation records.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "All evaluation found successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "programName": "string",
        "programType": "string",
        "programDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "location": "string",
        "programCoordinator": "string",
        "numberOfSponsors": 3,
        "listOfSponsors": "string",
        "sponsorshipType": "string",
        "partnerOrganizations": "string" | null,
        "partnershipLevel": "string",
        "numberOfParticipants": 50,
        "targetAudience": "string",
        "numberOfFacilitators": 5,
        "numberOfVolunteers": 10,
        "participantEngagementLevel": "string",
        "programObjectives": "string" | null,
        "objectiveAchievement": "string",
        "programOutcome": "string" | null,
        "programImpact": "string" | null,
        "majorActivities": "string" | null,
        "effectiveActivities": "string" | null,
        "venueSuitability": 4,
        "timeManagement": 3,
        "resourceAvailability": 4,
        "communicationAndCoordination": 5,
        "teamworkAmongOrganizers": 4,
        "challengesEncountered": "string" | null,
        "challengesAddressed": "string" | null,
        "lessonsLearned": "string" | null,
        "budgetAllocated": "string" | null,
        "budgetUtilized": "string" | null,
        "wereResourcesAdequate": "string" | null,
        "inadequateResourcesExplanation": "string" | null,
        "overallSuccess": "string" | null,
        "recommendTheProgram": "string" | null,
        "improvementSuggestions": "string" | null,
        "recommendFuturePrograms": "string" | null,
        "name": "string",
        "role": "string",
        "dateSubmitted": "YYYY-MM-DD",
        "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
        "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
        "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      },
      "metadata": {
        "participantsImpacted": 250,
        "organizationsPartneredWith": 5,
        "volunteersEngaged": 15,
        "workshopsConducted": 8
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  Results are cached under the key `cedarrise:capacity:evaluation:{page}:{limit}:{orderBy}:{sortBy}` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters.                             |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `read` permission.           |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                              |
}
